2","category":"battle","text":"yes～啪唧啪唧～给你～！","text_original":"イエースパチパチはい、どうぞー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"失礼啦～咻叭叭～完成！","text_original":"失礼しまーすシュパパパこんぷりーと！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"必杀！高速入场～！","text_original":"必殺！高速にゅうきょうー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"让我来让你变可爱吧～","text_original":"可愛くしてあげるねー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"确认完毕～","text_original":"確認かんりょー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"要给我吗～？谢谢～作为回报，我会保护老师的～","text_original":"くれるのー？ありがとー。代わりに、先生の事まもってあげるー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"出动～！","text_original":"しゅつどー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"光，入列～！","text_original":"ヒカリ、ごうりゅー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"光选手切换为飞行模式～嗡～","text_original":"ヒカリ選手の飛行モード移行ーブゥーン。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"海兰德铁道学院——橘光，登场～