_lobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"我吃不了～就给老师啦～","text_original":"ヒカリには無理だったからあげるー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"这个就交给光来做吧～","text_original":"これはヒカリがやっとくねー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"我能行的哦～毕竟今天是我值日啦～","text_original":"できるよー？当番だし？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"……（点头）嗯嗯……不小心睡着了~","text_original":"…………（コクン）んんっ、ねてたー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师～我可以坐你腿上吗～？","text_original":"せんせー、膝の上いいー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"不等回答就行动～这就是橘～光～","text_original":"返事は待たずに動くーそれが橘ヒカリー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师快看～像小狗狗一样的影子～","text_original":"見て見てせんせー。かげえのわんちゃんー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……哦～？那个是我吗？还有别的吗～？","text_original":"……おー？それ、わし？ほかはー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_login_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师～欢迎光临～。","text_original":"先生ーいらっしゃーい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_login_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"我一直在等你哦～","text_original":"待ってたよー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊～……茶水间的点心都吃光啦～","text_original":"あー……給湯室のお菓子、なくなっちゃったー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？可以吗～？","text_original":"ん？いいのー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"这里，这里～……","text_original":"ここ、ここー……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，再里面一点～","text_original":"そ～……おくのほ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"牙齿～好痛～","text_original":"はがーいたいー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"老师，看到了吗～？","text_original":"せんせー、みえるー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"右边后面的牙齿～好痛～","text_original":"みぎのおくばがねーいたいのー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"嗯嗯，那里……好疼～","text_original":"うう、そこ……ズキズキー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"欸～怎么办呀～光快要死掉了吗～？","text_original":"えーどうすればいいのーヒカリ死亡フラグー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"救命呀～老师……","text_original":"たすけてーせんせー……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_minigame_complete","category":"event","text":"乖—乖—好孩子—","text_original":"よしよしーいいこいいこー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_minigame_complete.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_minigame_train_start","category":"event","text":"咻咻砰砰—出发前进—","text_original":"しゅっしゅっぽっぽー出発進行ー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_minigame_train_start.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师～叫我了吗？一起玩吧～","text_original":"先生、呼んだ？あそぼー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"老师有什么想让我做的吗～？","text_original":"やってほしいことあるー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"以后也要一直和我玩哦～","text_original":"これからもずっと遊んでー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师总是陪我玩～最~喜欢老师啦～","text_original":"いつも遊んでくれてありがとー先生だーいすき。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"猜谜时间～今天是什么日子呢～？","text_original":"クイズー、今日は何の日でしょー？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"答对啦～是光和望的生日～求礼物中～什么都可以～","text_original":"正解ー、ヒカリとノゾミの誕生日ー。プレゼント求むー何でも歓迎ー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"夏莱乘务员呼叫中～请回应——锵——！！","text_original":"シャーレ乗務員、応答ねがうーじゃーん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天是老师的生日～恭喜恭喜～一起吃蛋糕吧～","text_original":"今日は先生のお誕生日ー。おめでとー。ケーキ一緒に食べよー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"trick or train～！","text_original":"トリックーオアートレーイン。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯～随便说的啦～给我糖～","text_original":"うんーテキトーに言っただけー。お菓子ちょうだいー","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"我决定好今年的目标啦～要把吃零食的量……减掉……！","text_original":"今年の抱負がきまったのだー。お菓子の量を……へらす……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯～还是明年再努力吧～","text_original":"……んーやっぱり来年頑張るー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师今年有哭吗～？光可没有哭哦～有忍住～","text_original":"先生は今年泣いたー？ヒカリは泣いてないよー我慢したー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0242_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以我能拿到礼物吗～？我可是乖乖的好孩子～","text_original":"だからプレゼントもらえるかなー？いいこにしてたのだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A9%98%20%E5%85%89/original/jp/ch0242_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"descrip